---
import OldSite from './OldSite.astro';
---

<section id="voorbeelden" style="max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(72px, 9vw, 130px) 24px 0">
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 380px), 1fr)); gap: 40px 64px; align-items: end">
<h2 class="rv sv" style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(40px, 5.2vw, 80px); line-height: .96; letter-spacing: -.04em">We sturen je geen offerte. We sturen je <span class="hl" style="background-image: linear-gradient(var(--marker), var(--marker))">je nieuwe homepage.</span></h2>
<div>
<div class="rv" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.05em; line-height: .9">
<span role="img" aria-label="23" style="font-size: clamp(72px, 9vw, 140px); color: var(--pen); text-decoration: line-through; text-decoration-thickness: .07em">23</span>
<svg width="72" height="48" viewBox="0 0 72 48" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 26 C 20 18, 40 20, 62 24 M46 8 l18 16 -20 14"></path></svg>
<span role="img" aria-label="98" class="count c98" style="--n: 98; font-size: clamp(72px, 9vw, 140px)"></span>
</div>
<p style="margin: 20px 0 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.55; color: #444444; max-width: 460px">Met je eigen teksten, je eigen merk en de beste beelden van je eigen sociale media. Je ziet eerst het resultaat. Pas dan praten we over geld.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<div class="scene" style="height: 1500px; margin-top: 56px">
<div style="position: sticky; top: 24px; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px">
<p style="margin: 0 0 6px; text-align: right; font: 700 34px/1 Caveat, cursive; color: var(--pen); rotate: 2deg">blijf scrollen ↓</p>
<div role="img" aria-label="De oude website verandert tijdens het scrollen in het nieuwe ontwerp" style="position: relative; filter: drop-shadow(14px 18px 0 rgba(17,17,17,.12))">
<div class="mock" aria-hidden="true">
<div class="in">
<OldSite />
</div>
<div class="in wipe" style="clip-path: inset(0 50% 0 0)">
<div class="chrome"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>https://voorbeeld-en-zonen.be</b></div>
<div class="ns">
<div class="ns-n"><strong>V&amp;Z</strong><span>Werk<span>Aanpak</span><span>Over ons</span><em>Offerte</em></span></div>
<div class="ns-b">
<div><h4>Vakwerk dat blijft.</h4><p>Drie generaties ervaring. Eén telefoontje en we staan er.</p><em>Plan een bezoek</em></div>
<div class="ns-p"><i style="width: 70%; aspect-ratio: 1; background: #F3C13A; right: -18%; top: -22%"></i><i style="width: 90%; aspect-ratio: 1; background: #0E3B2E; left: -30%; bottom: -55%"></i><i style="width: 34%; aspect-ratio: 1; background: #F3F1EA; right: 14%; bottom: 12%"></i></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<span class="knob" aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; top: -2%; bottom: -2%; left: 50%; width: 5px; margin-left: -2px; background: var(--pen)"></span>
<span style="position: absolute; left: 14px; bottom: -18px; background: #111111; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; padding: 8px 14px; rotate: -3deg">NA · 98</span>
<span style="position: absolute; right: 14px; bottom: -18px; background: var(--pen); color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; padding: 8px 14px; rotate: 3deg">VOOR · 23</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<section style="max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 24px clamp(72px, 9vw, 130px)">
<p style="margin: 0 0 36px; font: 700 clamp(30px, 3vw, 42px)/1 Caveat, cursive; color: var(--pen); rotate: -2deg">echte zaken, echte cijfers:</p>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 280px), 1fr)); gap: 40px">
<a class="pol rv" href="#start" style="--r: -3deg; text-decoration: none; background: #FFFFFF; border: 2px solid #111111; box-shadow: 10px 12px 0 rgba(17,17,17,.12); padding: 14px 14px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; position: relative">
<span aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; top: -16px; left: 50%; width: 110px; height: 30px; margin-left: -55px; background: var(--marker); opacity: .9; rotate: -4deg"></span>
<span style="aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; background: #E4E4E4; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: #444444; padding: 12px">[FOTO: VOOR EN NA CASE 1]</span>
<span style="font: 700 34px/1 Caveat, cursive">[Naam zaak], [gemeente]</span>
<span style="font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 30px"><span style="color: var(--pen)">[VOOR]</span> → [NA]</span>
</a>
<a class="pol rv" href="#start" style="--r: 2deg; text-decoration: none; background: #FFFFFF; border: 2px solid #111111; box-shadow: 10px 12px 0 rgba(17,17,17,.12); padding: 14px 14px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; position: relative">
<span aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; top: -16px; left: 50%; width: 110px; height: 30px; margin-left: -55px; background: var(--marker); opacity: .9; rotate: 3deg"></span>
<span style="aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; background: #E4E4E4; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: #444444; padding: 12px">[FOTO: VOOR EN NA CASE 2]</span>
<span style="font: 700 34px/1 Caveat, cursive">[Naam zaak], [gemeente]</span>
<span style="font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 30px"><span style="color: var(--pen)">[VOOR]</span> → [NA]</span>
</a>
<a class="pol rv" href="#start" style="--r: -1.5deg; text-decoration: none; background: var(--marker); border: 2px solid #111111; box-shadow: 10px 12px 0 rgba(17,17,17,.12); padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; min-height: 320px">
<span style="font: 700 34px/1 Caveat, cursive">de volgende:</span>
<span style="font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(48px, 5vw, 72px); line-height: .9; letter-spacing: -.04em">Jouw site?</span>
<span style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px">Stuur je URL, wij tonen het je
<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></span>
</a>
</div>
</section>
